// Register #13, the divergence at its simplest: no entry point, no seam use.
// The reference walks reachability from `main`, has no root here, and falls back
// to declaring the whole seam - thirteen externs for a file that references none
// of them. The port keys on what the emitted code actually names, so it declares
// nothing. Both emissions compile clean; the reference's thirteen lines are dead
// declarations rather than an error.

pub fn goodbye() {
    while false {
    }
}
